  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given circuit can be redrawn as:<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0107_2e3e43dda169.png\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 212px;\" /><br />Charge on <math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></math> capacitor:<br /><math><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p>in series combination charge remains same.</p><p>so,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p>"
